{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"agent_message","text":"The fixed check observed a complete recurring state while automatic exit remained pending. Between ticks 20 and 30, all three nodes exchanged 20 heartbeats and 20 replies, retained their roles and term, and drained all work. I independently reconstructed the saved state records and confirmed the equality.\n\nThe no-transfer control exited normally, and a later proposal recovered the stalled case. The result supports a lost automatic-continuation finding for this schedule, not a safety violation or a claim that ordinary proposals cannot progress.\n"}}
